    <string name="privacy_title">How Awake Steps uses your data</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Awake Steps reads your steps, calories burned, distance and sleep sessions from Health Connect. Sleep is used only to work out when your day starts (when you wake up) and ends (when you go to sleep); steps, calories and distance are added up between those times.\n\nEverything is processed on your phone. Nothing is uploaded or shared, and the app never writes to Health Connect.\n\nIf you connect Google Health in Settings, the app also reads the same kinds of data from your Google Health account, over the internet, using the access you grant on Google’s sign-in screen. It only reads; it never changes your Google Health data or sends it anywhere else. Disconnect any time in Settings, and remove access in your Google account.\n\nYou can revoke access at any time in Health Connect settings.</string>
